{"cmd":"add","id":"node_spa_shell","type":"card","group":"group_frontend_shell","data":{"title":"index.html — App Shell (think4ever branded)","description":"Single-page application shell for the 'LATAM Market Intelligence — Geo DB Colombia' demo built for the client Kurian under the think4ever brand. The UI is in Spanish (lang es-CO). It renders a persistent sidebar and an empty <main id='page-main'> container. js/app.js fills that container with load_page(name). The sidebar exposes two business areas. 'Análisis' contains Mapa (map_view) and Comparar (compare_view). 'Calidad de datos' contains Panel de aceptación (acceptance_panel) and Explorador de tablas (table_explorer). The footer states a business and privacy rule: all figures are aggregates and no personal data is shown. The shell supports light/dark theming, has a skip-link for accessibility, and swaps per-page CSS through the #page-css link. There is no login, so every visitor (analyst, demo viewer or data steward) can use every view.","tags":["domain:frontend","domain:market-intelligence","role:analyst","role:data-steward","role:guest","tech:spa","tech:bootstrap","tech:leaflet","integration:cdn","flow:navigation"],"sourceFiles":["public/index.html"]}}
{"cmd":"add","id":"group_education","type":"group","data":{"label":"Education Pipeline (Schools, Higher Ed, Saber 11)","icon":"fa-solid fa-graduation-cap","color":"#F4ECF7","borderColor":"#8E44AD"}}
{"cmd":"add","id":"group_education_pipeline","type":"group","data":{"label":"Education Pipeline (Schools, Saber 11, Higher Ed)","icon":"fa-solid fa-graduation-cap","color":"#F4ECF7","borderColor":"#8E44AD"}}
{"cmd":"add","id":"group_business","type":"group","data":{"label":"Business Demand & Market Size (Companies, SECOP, Vacancies)","icon":"fa-solid fa-briefcase","color":"#FDEDEC","borderColor":"#CB4335"}}
{"cmd":"add","id":"group_tech_ecosystem","type":"group","data":{"label":"Tech Ecosystem & Community","icon":"fa-solid fa-code","color":"#EAFAF1","borderColor":"#229954"}}
{"cmd":"add","id":"node_server","type":"card","group":"group_platform","data":{"title":"Express Application Server (server.js)","description":"This is the single entry point of the LATAM Market Intelligence Geo DB Colombia demo built for Kurian. It serves the static analyst frontend (public/) at '/'. A workspace proxy strips the /run/<projectId> prefix, so the frontend must use relative URLs only. The server exposes health endpoints that return HTTP 200 or 503 depending on the result from lib/mapData.getHealth(). It also mounts the map/compare router (routes/map) and the data-governance router (routes/v1). PORT is mandatory: if the runtime does not inject it, the process logs an error and exits with code 1. The app has no authentication layer, so every endpoint is public. That fits a read-only demo for market analysts.","tags":["domain:platform","tech:express","tech:nodejs","role:market-analyst","role:operator","integration:mysql"],"sourceFiles":["server.js"]}}
