{"cmd":"add","id":"node_page_map_view","type":"card","group":"group_frontend","data":{"title":"Map View Page — 'Mapa' (map_view)","description":"Route shim for the geographic visualisation module (window.T4EMapView from js/map_view.js). Business purpose: choropleth and point maps of Colombian market opportunity using geo_department_shape GeoJSON, municipality points and Bogotá localidad polygons, colored by selected fact metrics. Must handle NULL geometry cases (Nuevo Belén de Bajirá, Medellín comunas) gracefully.","tags":["domain:geo-visualization","role:analyst","tech:geojson","flow:map-exploration","entity:geo_zone"],"sourceFiles":["public/js/pages/map_view.js"]}}
