{"cmd":"add","id":"node_page_compare_view","type":"card","group":"group_frontend","data":{"title":"Compare View Page — 'Comparar' (compare_view)","description":"Route shim for the territorial comparison module (window.T4ECompareView from js/compare_view.js). Business purpose: side-by-side comparison of departments/municipalities/zones on market indicators—persona employment, students and ICT enrollment, Saber 11 scores, micro-businesses, IT companies, SECOP value, vacancies, dev communities—to choose launch markets.","tags":["domain:market-intelligence","role:analyst","role:business-strategist","flow:market-comparison","entity:department","entity:municipality"],"sourceFiles":["public/js/pages/compare_view.js"]}}
