{"cmd":"add","id":"flow_market_analysis","type":"note","group":"group_frontend","data":{"text":"**Flow: Analyst Market Exploration**\n1. Analyst opens SPA shell; navigates to a route (map_view / compare_view / table_explorer / acceptance_panel)\n2. Shell loads js/pages/{id}.js → shim registers page → lazily injects js/{id}.js\n3. Module init(root) fetches data from Express API (backed by pool → MySQL)\n4. Mapa: choose metric → choropleth by department / points by municipality / Bogotá localidades\n5. Comparar: pick territories → side-by-side indicators\n6. Table Explorer: browse raw tables & sources\n7. Leaving route → destroy() cleans up\n\n**Errors:** script load failure → Spanish error message, retry allowed\n**Roles:** Analyst, business strategist (read-only)","color":"#ddf4ff","sourceFiles":["public/js/pages/map_view.js","public/js/pages/compare_view.js","public/js/pages/table_explorer.js","public/js/pages/acceptance_panel.js"]}}
