{"cmd":"link","id":"link_explorer_map","from":"node_table_explorer","to":"node_map_view","label":"opens map","toArrow":"arrow","sourceFiles":["public/pages/table_explorer.html"]}
{"cmd":"add","id":"flow_deploy_verify","type":"note","group":"group_qa","data":{"text":"**Flow: Demo Readiness Verification**\n1. Developer pre-checks: check-syntax, check-map-view, check-map, check-tables and check-v1 (no running server needed, except check-v1, which uses an ephemeral port).\n2. Start the service (npm start with PORT injected).\n3. Run probe-boot.js: the endpoints must not return 5xx, and a direct DB row count is checked.\n4. Run smoke.js (10 PASS/FAIL checks) and smoke-extra.js.\n5. Exit code 0 means the demo is ready for the Kurian presentation.","color":"#FDEDEC","sourceFiles":["scripts/smoke.js","scripts/probe-boot.js","scripts/check-syntax.js","scripts/check-map-view.js","scripts/check-map.js","scripts/check-tables.js","scripts/check-v1.js","scripts/smoke-extra.js"]}}
