{"cmd":"add","id":"flow_data_acceptance","type":"note","group":"group_ui_pages","data":{"text":"**Flow: Data acceptance check**\n1. Engineer opens Panel de aceptación and runs checks (is-running: spinner, dimmed table)\n2. Each check compares loaded data against expectations (e.g. dictionary row counts: 33 depts, 1,123 municipalities, 41 zones; totals within tolerance)\n3. Results grouped by section; failing rows tinted red; state dot per check\n4. Verdict banner: pass (green) or fail (red) with timestamp/batch metadata\n5. Issue list classifies findings by severity pill (info/warn/error) with table/column raw names\n6. Batch figures summarise loaded tables/rows/issues\n\n**Roles:** data engineer, QA, project owner\n**Errors:** fail verdict blocks trust in downstream map/compare figures","color":"#FDEDEC","sourceFiles":["public/css/pages/acceptance_panel.css","data/geodb-v2/diccionario.md"]}}
