{"cmd":"add","id":"node_global_css","type":"card","group":"group_ui","data":{"title":"Global CSS — Quarterly Theme & Brand","description":"This stylesheet defines the shared visual language of the think4ever Geo DB Colombia product.\n- Brand tokens: navy #11255A and orange #E8772E.\n- A 5-step choropleth ramp (--ramp-1..5) plus --nodata grey, matching the map quintiles.\n- Typography: Inter, Manrope and a monospace face.\n- Light and dark mode via prefers-color-scheme or [data-theme], including a filter that darkens Leaflet map tiles.\n- Layout contract: app-shell with a sticky navy sidebar that turns into a top bar under 768px; map-layout uses a 330px side panel plus the canvas.\nShared components:\n- .table-navy for data tables.\n- .raw-name: monospace, never-translated table, column and code names.\n- .pill-ok/warn/fail/info for acceptance statuses.\n- .check-dot for pass/fail indicators.\n- .delta-pos/neg for comparisons.\n- .na for missing data.\n- Leaflet tooltip styling.\nAccessibility support: a skip-link and focus-visible outlines.","tags":["domain:ui","tech:css","tech:leaflet","a11y","role:market-analyst"],"sourceFiles":["public/css/global.css"]}}
